strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/117347-idigam-chronicles-general-discussion?p=122648#post122648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It was actually somewhat nonsense, and wasn't really going anywhere. Sorry to have gotten your hopes up. It was unintentional. I was trying to run the &quot;fooled me!&quot; joke, that's all. You have my apologies.</div> </div> </div> </div>You forget you are posting in the Werewolf section of the forums. We have more impulse than brains here and are pretty much drooling all over the place in searh juicy tidbits (puns very much intended).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","name":"Dessembrae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T12:00:49-07:00","id":123912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/117347-idigam-chronicles-general-discussion?p=122349#post122349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See Christian it boggles me that you'd take this stance on it, it so far sounds incredibly brilliant and already set my brain meats into overdrive thinking of awesome scenarios.<br /> <br /> Pack of Predator Kings murders the players human and wolf blooded pack while they're out on a proper hunt...<br /> <br /> Hell seeing as how my two main players are usually an elodoth and irraka (respectively a storm lord and an Iron master) I would think a serial killer being urged / ridden by a murder spirit would make for an amazing storyline. Murder mystery all criminal minds style followed by a right proper hunt from the main characters tracking down what could essentially be jack the ripper or the zodiac killer.<br /> <br /> If anything its added quite a bit to a dramatic perspective and opened the werewolves up for more relate able play, which is all around better. If you can really get into the character then it makes it far funner to play, and I feel this will be the case with Idigam. Hell we might even pick up all the teen fiction reader fans and educate them on proper werewolf fiction while we're at it. And there's nothing wrong with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>For me, at least, Idigam brings too much baggage with it... Specifically, the GMC Mechanics. The Werewolf ideas are awesome, to be sure, but I just cannot get behind the GMC mechanics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The problem with defending the purity of the English language is that English is about as pure as a cribhouse whore. We don't just borrow words; on occasion, English has pursued other languages down alleyways to beat them unconscious and rifle their pockets for new vocabulary. - James. D. Nicoll</span></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","name":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":