br /> Had a fun little house rule when we played. After defeating an enemy, a howl of victory would restore Essence (and a Willpower on Exceptional), and Gauru got bonuses for that. I did this specifically because I wanted huge, blood-splattered wolf-beasts howling to the moon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T15:18:32-07:00","id":259290,"title":"","content":"Sooo... No pressure guys (at least no more pressure than what you're already under), but, any updates on the current state of development? I'm all good and saved up already, but throwing money at the comp doesn't seem to be doing anything...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3702-ursufgutha-storm-born","name":"Ursufgutha Storm-Born","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T15:35:05-07:00","id":259309,"title":"","content":"As much as I hate to add to the nagging, I could definitely do with either this or Book of the Deceived.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T15:43:53-07:00","id":259313,"title":"","content":"Perhaps something of a time table? I do love how the schedule has changed from month by month to season by season. It was interesting to see Idigam consistently on the next months release dates lol.<br /> <br /> I'm good on waiting though. &gt;.&gt; Just tell me its only a few months away. (Lie to me its ok!)<br /> <br /> In the mean while I've got book of the wyrm 20th and umbra 20th to anticipate, as well as the new w20 books! Book on the war of rage? Hell yes!<br /> <br /> Edit: Any anyone thinking that Dalu form can't be that terrifying? Go watch the Film 'Wer'. You can get it on the playstation store. Friggin amazingly violent werewolf movie. Guys form is essentially Dalu. Very minor upshift. Very good at splattering human skulls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":1939,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","user":"Lyrics Of War","date":". 09-17-2014, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T16:07:17-07:00","id":259324,"title":"","content":"The new Wolfman movie is basically all around Dalu kicking ass.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T16:41:37-07:00","id":259354,"title":"","content":"I heard that film was rather lack luster? Truth to that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T16:57:37-07:00","id":259365,"title":"","content":"The Wolfman is great inspiration for setting up First Change scenarios, as well as &quot;You made me what I am!&quot; stories (issues with Uratha parentage, etc.). Minor gripe for me, though, is the time period it's set in; it's pretty distant from when our games are usually set, although that's alright (like I said, minor gripe).<br /> <br /> Wer is<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Excellent for, basically, portraying the horror of a Ghost Wolf (or maybe Wolf-Blooded with the Dalu/Kuruth aspect) with no knowledge of the Oath, Harmony, maybe not even the Spirit World, inches from turning into Zi'ir.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I agree that both are great for showing asskicking in Dalu, of course. ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3702-ursufgutha-storm-born","name":"Ursufgutha Storm-Born","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T19:22:09-07:00","id":259429,"title":"","content":"Well we're into pre-editing development at the moment. Then editing, then post editing development. IanW said these last stages can go by surprisingly fast.<br /> We don't seem to be on the art direction stuff, based on the Monday Meetings. I don't know what that means.<br /> <br /> And yeah, Wer isn't a great movie, but it's a good werewolf movie. Always hard to find good werewolf media that isn't paranormal romance or werewolf-as-mindless-slasher.<br /> <br /> I know we probably won't get much writing on them, but I'm looking forward to the new shartha, too. At the least more hints on the rarer hosts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T19:43:46-07:00","id":259443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/117347-idigam-chronicles-general-discussion?p=259429#post259429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well we're into pre-editing development at the moment. Then editing, then post editing development. IanW said these last stages can go by surprisingly fast.<br /> We don't seem to be on the art direction stuff, based on the Monday Meetings. I don't know what that means.<br /> And yeah, Wer isn't a great movie, but it's a good werewolf movie. Always hard to find good werewolf media that isn't paranormal romance or werewolf-as-mindless-slasher.<br /> I know we probably won't get much writing on them, but I'm looking forward to the new shartha, too. At the least more hints on the rarer hosts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome to hear about the game's current status. I'm of the opinion that it's better they take time producing it, making it into the top-notch game it could be, rather than hurrying; it's just that that does not necessarily make the waiting any easier, and it's been a pretty quiet week. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Hmmm, new shartha, you say? I know they were already around before, but are you saying there would be more emphasis on them, perhaps to present the Hunters in Darkness with more prey choices to sink their teeth into?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3702-ursufgutha-storm-born","name":"Ursufgutha Storm-Born","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T20:00:24-07:00","id":259452,"title":"","content":"I'm not a developer or involved with the company in any way shape or form other than being a fan and customer, just repeating stuff I've heard from other sources regarding the book coming out. I agree. But it's a hard balance to take your time and keep interests stoked. Blood and Smoke was good, Fallen World seems pleasing to its fans, what we've -heard- from WtF 2 seems good. So it seems like we'll enjoy it.<br /> <br /> The shartha thing is just a personal desire. It would make sense for there to be more shartha, even the Predators book suggests there's more than the 'big two' of the azlu and the beshilu and the few minor ones they and other books detail. I'm probably missing some but ummm...rat, spider, snake, locust, crow, fungus, worm, wolf, 'clutter' which may or not be the Cat Host, and rumors of bee and ghost shartha. Looking back at the list, it seems like there's a lot already. But I'm greedy.<br /> <br /> I'm wondering what the other changing breeds might be considered, in terms of sacred prey. I don't think those from the changing breeds book count as 'canon' but the Unclean, Baal-hadad and others from the War Against the Pure seem more in line with Forsaken. I suppose it would be easy to figure they were werewolves 'usurped' by some powerful spirit, or who surrendered themselves to it, hollowing out the wolf and replacing it with something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-17-2014, 11:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T22:11:57-07:00","id":259522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/117347-idigam-chronicles-general-discussion?p=259313#post259313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps something of a time table?<br /> <br /> In the mean while I've got book of the wyrm 20th and umbra 20th to anticipate, as well as the new w20 books! Book on the war of rage? Hell yes!</div> </div> </div> </div>I know these things aren't strictly in order, but my Umbra final drafts were handed in mid-May, and it's nearly ready to be published.<br /> <br /> Idigam/Forsaken 2nd ed final drafts went in mid-August.<br /> <br /> If that helps at all with expectations of time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T22:17:41-07:00","id":259524,"title":"","content":"It helps create the picture.<br /> <br /> The picture is pain though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T22:31:40-07:00","id":259547,"title":"","content":"Late Christmas presents for me and my players! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3702-ursufgutha-storm-born","name":"Ursufgutha Storm-Born","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T02:40:32-07:00","id":259628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/117347-idigam-chronicles-general-discussion?p=259522#post259522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know these things aren't strictly in order, but my Umbra final drafts were handed in mid-May, and it's nearly ready to be published.<br /> <br /> Idigam/Forsaken 2nd ed final drafts went in mid-August.<br /> <br /> If that helps at all with expectations of time.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So what, about late December maybe? <b>Forsaken 2ed</b> on this Christmas is realistic?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T03:00:46-07:00","id":259649,"title":"","content":"No idea, I'm just sayign when we submitted drafts. How long it takes then is a mysterious process.<br /> <br /> As a rule of thumb, assume no, assume it will take longer, and then if it's shorter, everyone feels happier.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T04:37:12-07:00","id":259689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/117347-idigam-chronicles-general-discussion?p=259309#post259309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As much as I hate to add to the nagging, I could definitely do with either this or <b>Book of the Deceived</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, nice to see you here, too! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T05:33:53-07:00","id":259699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a 